WEBVTT

00:00:01.573 --> 00:00:04.993
You want ollivanders.
There ain't no place better.

00:00:05.702 --> 00:00:10.790
Run along there and wait.
I got one more thing to do.

00:00:28.808 --> 00:00:30.643
Hello?

00:00:33.605 --> 00:00:35.440
Hello?

00:00:38.943 --> 00:00:43.239
I wondered when
I'd be seeing you, Mr. Potter.

00:00:51.039 --> 00:00:53.249
It seems only yesterday...

00:00:53.499 --> 00:00:59.339
That your mother and father were
in here buying their first wands.

00:01:06.012 --> 00:01:08.306
Here we are.

00:01:16.856 --> 00:01:19.442
Give it a wave.

00:01:25.865 --> 00:01:28.451
Apparently not.

00:01:35.875 --> 00:01:38.086
Perhaps...

00:01:39.712 --> 00:01:41.881
This.

00:01:48.972 --> 00:01:53.601
No, no, definitely not. No matter.

00:02:00.817 --> 00:02:02.402
I wonder...

00:02:31.639 --> 00:02:33.933
Curious.

00:02:34.142 --> 00:02:37.061
Very curious.

00:02:37.270 --> 00:02:40.398
Sorry, but what's curious?

00:02:42.108 --> 00:02:45.403
I remember every wand
I've ever sold, Mr. Potter.

00:02:45.611 --> 00:02:48.364
It so happens that the Phoenix...

00:02:48.573 --> 00:02:53.286
Whose tail feather resides
in your wand, gave another feather.

00:02:53.703 --> 00:02:56.789
Just one other.

00:02:56.956 --> 00:03:01.294
It is curious that you should
be destined for this wand...

00:03:01.586 --> 00:03:07.258
When its brother gave you that scar.

00:03:09.093 --> 00:03:12.305
And who owned that wand?

00:03:13.139 --> 00:03:15.558
We do not speak his name.

00:03:15.975 --> 00:03:19.479
The wand chooses
the wizard, Mr. Potter.

00:03:19.729 --> 00:03:22.732
It's not always clear why.

00:03:23.107 --> 00:03:26.611
But I think it is clear...

00:03:26.819 --> 00:03:30.740
That we can expect
great things from you.

00:03:30.948 --> 00:03:35.203
After all, he-who-must-not-be-named...

00:03:35.453 --> 00:03:38.122
Did great things.

00:03:38.331 --> 00:03:40.333
Terrible...

00:03:40.792 --> 00:03:44.003
Yes, but great.

